WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Local AI. Ready for your app?
Your hardware. Your model. A few important questions.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.600
Meet DeviceBench.
Three tools. One local workspace.

00:09.600 --> 00:16.800
Local AI Doctor: check your runtime, installed models, and hardware.
Read-only checks. No model is loaded.

00:16.800 --> 00:24.000
Model & Context Checker: inspect context limits and estimate memory.
An estimate is not a guarantee that a model will load.

00:24.000 --> 00:31.200
App Compatibility Tester: test streaming, structured JSON, tool calling, or embeddings.
Support depends on the selected model and server.

00:31.200 --> 00:36.000
Choose a preset for a chatbot, data extraction, tool assistant, or semantic search.
Adjust the checks and run when you are ready.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.800
Keep the evidence.
Download a readable HTML report or use the JSON in your workflow.

00:40.800 --> 00:44.400
Your machine. Clear next steps.
Diagnose, inspect, test, and export. No account required.

00:44.400 --> 00:48.000
DeviceBench. Explore the V1 preview.
